    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684120/extras/69ee58df89dea4cdebbfdcb3c5d2bf02.avif?t=1708475072\" width=653 height=211 /></span><br><br>To complete your objectives you will control one of four custom vehicles.  Each vehicle is suited to a specific task so you'll need to be sure to pick the right one.  You'll need all the advantages you can get to defeat the enemy vehicles, buildings and bosses that stand in your way.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vehicles</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Tank</strong><br>     Built to destroy other vehicles, the tank is quick and agile.<br>     <u>Primary Weapon:</u> Anti-vehicle cannon<br>     <u>Secondary Weapon:</u> Projectile shield<br>     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684120/extras/915a5785cb9b15aadda52ef8274994c8.poster.avif?t=1708475072\" width=128 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684120/extras/915a5785cb9b15aadda52ef8274994c8.webm?t=1708475072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684120/extras/915a5785cb9b15aadda52ef8274994c8.mp4?t=1708475072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li><strong>Drone</strong><br>     Incredibly fast, the drone is good at sniffing out those hard to find objectives.<br>     <u>Primary Weapon:</u> Dash<br>     <u>Secondary Weapon:</u> Places teleport beacons for the siege vehicle<br>     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684120/extras/2dfdb0bba40ab0c69792d7bd14cb1569.poster.avif?t=1708475072\" width=128 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684120/extras/2dfdb0bba40ab0c69792d7bd14cb1569.webm?t=1708475072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684120/extras/2dfdb0bba40ab0c69792d7bd14cb1569.mp4?t=1708475072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li><strong>Siege</strong><br>     Ponderously slow and inept at destroying vehicles, the siege vehicle is hell on wheels when it comes to taking down turrets and walls.<br>     <u>Primary Weapon:</u> Teleport to beacon<br>     <u>Secondary Weapon:</u> Deploy to artillery mode<br>     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684120/extras/16888ec1aeb1754aeb57ad6f58f6631a.poster.avif?t=1708475072\" width=128 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684120/extras/16888ec1aeb1754aeb57ad6f58f6631a.webm?t=1708475072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684120/extras/16888ec1aeb1754aeb57ad6f58f6631a.mp4?t=1708475072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li><strong>Builder</strong><br>     Can construct all manner of helpful buildings, such as the mini-tank factory and turrets.<br>     <u>Primary Weapon:</u> Build Building<br>     <u>Secondary Weapon:</u> Place Landmine<br>     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684120/extras/6396f87cda3b01e71929f40dc27d5ac5.poster.avif?t=1708475072\" width=128 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684120/extras/6396f87cda3b01e71929f40dc27d5ac5.webm?t=1708475072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684120/extras/6396f87cda3b01e71929f40dc27d5ac5.mp4?t=1708475072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684120/extras/69ee58df89dea4cdebbfdcb3c5d2bf02.avif?t=1708475072\" width=653 height=211 /></span><br><br>To complete your objectives you will control one of four custom vehicles.  Each vehicle is suited to a specific task so you'll need to be sure to pick the right one.  You'll need all the advantages you can get to defeat the enemy vehicles, buildings and bosses that stand in your way.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vehicles</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Tank</strong><br>     Built to destroy other vehicles, the tank is quick and agile.<br>     <u>Primary Weapon:</u> Anti-vehicle cannon<br>     <u>Secondary Weapon:</u> Projectile shield<br>     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684120/extras/915a5785cb9b15aadda52ef8274994c8.poster.avif?t=1708475072\" width=128 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684120/extras/915a5785cb9b15aadda52ef8274994c8.webm?t=1708475072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684120/extras/915a5785cb9b15aadda52ef8274994c8.mp4?t=1708475072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li><strong>Drone</strong><br>     Incredibly fast, the drone is good at sniffing out those hard to find objectives.<br>     <u>Primary Weapon:</u> Dash<br>     <u>Secondary Weapon:</u> Places teleport beacons for the siege vehicle<br>     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684120/extras/2dfdb0bba40ab0c69792d7bd14cb1569.poster.avif?t=1708475072\" width=128 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps